{"pageid":4403,"title":"Oak Burl","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Oak Burl</span>","revid":19674,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/Burls\" title=\"Burls\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Oak Burls</b> can rarely spawn on the base of Oak Trees, requiring larger trees to spawn on. Oak Burls are very rare outside of the Junkyard, where the largest Oak Trees grow, though are more common than other burls. They spawn in clusters of two to four.\n</p><p><br />\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Oak Burl</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"RawImage\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/OakBurlDone.png/revision/latest?cb=20250928023159\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"OakBurlDone\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/OakBurlDone.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250928023159\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/OakBurlDone.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250928023159 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ec/OakBurlDone.png/revision/latest?cb=20250928023159 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"OakBurlDone\" width=\"270\" height=\"288\" data-image-key=\"OakBurlDone.png\" data-image-name=\"OakBurlDone.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"sanded\">Sanded</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image2\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/SandedOakBurlDone.png/revision/latest?cb=20250928023207\" class=\"im